{"version":1,"content":"<p>譚仔創辦人的媳婦蔡天鳳被殺案，其前夫、前家翁和前大伯各被控謀殺及阻止合法埋葬屍體罪。</p><p>案件今日（13日）在高院續審。</p><p>蔡天鳳伴侶譚方駿，以及負責聯絡事主家屬的偵緝警員高恩祺作供。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-13T06:20:42.707464+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":89,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked"},"published_at":"2026-10-13T06:14:48+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-13T07:58:20.542364+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:17:43.030580+00:00","content_hash":"2cce2323cd80740d8f712787df92b92eb86a68411bda0c3ce45b2e8a7be3be57","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null}